.target sm_89
.address_size 64
// Optimization: output-channel tiling for shared-memory reuse.
// Each CTA owns one output tile of 25(h) x 10(w) for a fixed (n, d)
// but now computes 8 output channels at once. The staged input halo
// tile (3c x 3kd x 27h x 10w) is loaded from global memory once and
// every shared input value feeds 8 FMAs (one per output channel),
// amortizing the global staging traffic 8x and cutting the grid 8x.
